  "flood_prone_notes": [
    {
      "text_fil": "Dahil sa ulang dala ng habagat noong Agosto 17, 2026, nagbukas ang Pasig ng 18 evacuation center sa 10 barangay: Bagong Ilog, Dela Paz, Kapasigan, Pinagbuhatan, Maybunga, Rosario, Santolan, San Miguel, Sta. Lucia at Ugong. May mga nakahandang center sa Manggahan at Sumilang.",
      "text_en": "During the 17 August 2026 habagat rains, Pasig opened 18 evacuation centers in 10 barangays: Bagong Ilog, Dela Paz, Kapasigan, Pinagbuhatan, Maybunga, Rosario, Santolan, San Miguel, Sta. Lucia and Ugong. Manggahan and Sumilang had centers on standby.",
      "sources": [
        "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2286819/pasig-evacuates-3189-residents-amid-habagat-rains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text_fil": "Lumikas ang mga residente sa 15 barangay dahil sa ulan noong Hulyo 22, 2025: Bagong Ilog, Caniogan, Dela Paz, Kapasigan, Pinagbuhatan, Malinao, Manggahan, Maybunga, San Joaquin, San Miguel, Santolan, Rosario, Sta. Lucia, Sta. Rosa at Ugong. Ilang beses nang kinailangang lumikas ang mga residente sa mga barangay na ito. Tinatayang karamihan ay nasa tabi ng Ilog Pasig, Ilog Marikina o Manggahan Floodway. Walang nakasaad na lokasyon sa sanggunian.",
      "text_en": "On 22 July 2025, rains displaced residents in 15 barangays: Bagong Ilog, Caniogan, Dela Paz, Kapasigan, Pinagbuhatan, Malinao, Manggahan, Maybunga, San Joaquin, San Miguel, Santolan, Rosario, Sta. Lucia, Sta. Rosa and Ugong. These barangays repeatedly need evacuation; most lie along the Pasig and Marikina rivers or the Manggahan Floodway (location inferred, not stated in the source).",
      "sources": [
        "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2085311/over-3000-families-in-pasig-city-seek-temporary-shelter-amid-rains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text_fil": "Ayon sa iDRRM profile ng DILG-NCR, ang mga panganib sa Pasig ay lindol, liquefaction, sunog, at baha.",
      "text_en": "The DILG-NCR iDRRM profile lists Pasig's hazards as earthquake, liquefaction, fire and flood.",
      "sources": [
        "https://idrrm.ncr.dilg.gov.ph/lgu-profile/22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text_fil": "Mga rescue base ng Pasig DRRMO (mula sa Citizen's Charter ng DRRMO, mga 2022): Fire and Rescue Base sa Red TC, Caniogan; San Joaquin Base sa Elisco Rd.; Fire and Rescue Boat sa Bambang-Kalawaan Bridge; Panthom (sic) Base sa Mega Market, Palatiw; Falcon Base sa Bartville Subd., Dela Paz.",
      "text_en": "Pasig DRRMO rescue bases (from the DRRMO Citizen's Charter, about 2022): Fire and Rescue Base at Red TC, Caniogan; San Joaquin Base on Elisco Rd.; Fire and Rescue Boat at Bambang-Kalawaan Bridge; Panthom (sic) Base at Mega Market, Palatiw; Falcon Base at Bartville Subd., Dela Paz.",
      "sources": [
        "https://assets.pasigcity.gov.ph/storage/attachments/disaster_risk_reduction_and_management_office/633f8800db42116651079686335211cbe1911664426268CCh_DRRMO.docx.pdf"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes_fil": "Ayon sa Inquirer, binuksan ng lungsod ang mga evacuation center na ito noong mga pag-ulan ng Hulyo 2025 at Agosto 2026. Tingnan ang mga opisyal na abiso para sa kumpletong listahan. May markang “Sinusuri pa” ang center na minsan lang nabanggit sa dalawang ulat. Wala pang nahanap na impormasyon tungkol sa mga barangay health center.",
  "notes_en": "Evacuation centers are the ones the city opened during specific rain events in July 2025 and August 2026, as reported by Inquirer; this is not an official master list. verify=true marks a center that appears in only one of the two events. Health centers (barangay health centers) were not found."
}
